---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getGameBySlug } from '../lib/content';
const seasons = getGameBySlug('seasons');
---
<BaseLayout active="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="kicker">Archive / Memory / Lake</div>
      <h1>进入<br />锈湖档案</h1>
      <p>按照作品、时间、人物与线索重新阅读 Rusty Lake / Cube Escape 的故事。当前 MVP 以 <strong>Cube Escape: Seasons</strong> 为第一套结构化样例，并默认保护跨作品剧透。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button" href="/read/seasons/spring-1964">开始阅读 Seasons</a>
        <a class="button-ghost" href="/progress">设置游玩进度</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-file">
      <article class="file-card">
        <div class="kicker">Case File 01</div>
        <div class="stamp">OPEN</div>
        <h2>{seasons?.title.zhHans ?? 'Cube Escape: Seasons'}</h2>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <div class="file-meta">
          <div><div class="muted">STATUS</div><b>PARTIAL ARCHIVE</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">FIRST MEMORY</div><b>1964 · SPRING</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">LANGUAGE</div><b>中文 / EN</b></div>
          <div><div class="muted">SPOILER</div><b>CONTROLLED</b></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="home-grid" aria-label="探索入口">
    <a class="home-tile" href="/games"><div class="kicker">01</div><b>按游戏阅读</b><span>从 Seasons 开始，后续作品按同一 Schema 持续加入。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/timeline"><div class="kicker">02</div><b>故事时间线</b><span>按照故事年份而不是发布时间重新组织事件。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/characters"><div class="kicker">03</div><b>人物档案</b><span>阅读过程中点击名字即可打开当前可见档案。</span></a>
    <a class="home-tile" href="/progress"><div class="kicker">04</div><b>防剧透进度</b><span>进度仅保存在当前浏览器，不需要注册账号。</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
